---json
{
  "lang": "en",
  "slug": "capsar",
  "title": "Capsar.io — Privacy-First BEP & EIR Platform | Andrea Aita",
  "description": "Capsar.io is a privacy-first BEP and EIR platform with guided authoring, requirement tracking, and structured exports for infrastructure and confidentiality-sensitive projects.",
  "ogTitle": "Capsar.io — Privacy-First BEP & EIR Platform",
  "ogDescription": "A privacy-first BEP and EIR platform built by a practitioner for infrastructure, public-sector, and confidentiality-sensitive teams.",
  "ogImageAlt": "Noein Solutions — Information Management and Digital Delivery Consulting",
  "css": [
    "capsar.css"
  ],
  "footerGithub": true,
  "hasMirror": true,
  "calendly": true
}
---
{% from "macros/blocks.njk" import sectionHead %}
<main id="main-content">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero hero--compact">
    <div class="hero-inner hero-inner--centered">
      <div class="hero-label">Capsar.io</div>
      <h1>A BEP platform that reads your EIR<br>and <em>guides your response</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        AI-assisted BEP authoring, EIR requirement extraction, responsiveness tracking, and professional document export &mdash; all in one platform. Built by a practitioner with live delivery experience across infrastructure, aviation, and regulated programmes. ISO 19650-native.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions hero-actions--center">
        <a href="https://app.noeinsolutions.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Try Capsar.io</a>
        <a href="bep-checklist.html" class="btn btn-outline">Open the BEP checklist</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fade-in">
    <div class="capsar-proof-card">
      <div>
        {{ sectionHead("Product Proof", "See the workflow before you commit", "A live preview of BEP authoring and requirement tracking is available below. Teams can evaluate how Capsar maps EIR requirements to BEP responses before onboarding.", "left") }}
        <a href="#platform-preview" class="btn btn-outline">Jump to product preview</a>
      </div>
      <div class="capsar-proof-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mockup-chrome">
          <div class="mockup-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="mockup-url">app.noeinsolutions.com/preview</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-screen">
          <div class="mockup-sidebar">
            <div class="mockup-sidebar-item active"></div>
            <div class="mockup-sidebar-item"></div>
            <div class="mockup-sidebar-item"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-content">
            <div class="mockup-heading"></div>
            <div class="mockup-field"></div>
            <div class="mockup-field short"></div>
            <div class="mockup-ai-badge">Guided workflow</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pain Points -->
  <section class="fade-in">
    {{ sectionHead("The Problem", "Why BEPs are still broken", "Four problems that every BIM manager and information manager recognises.") }}

    <div class="pain-grid">
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-num">01</div>
        <h3>Blank-page paralysis</h3>
        <p>Every BEP starts from a blank template or a copy of the last one. There&rsquo;s no structured starting point, so teams spend days just getting the document framework right before writing any actual content.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-num">02</div>
        <h3>EIRs are dense PDFs</h3>
        <p>Client requirements are buried in 30&ndash;50 page documents with no structure. Extracting what matters &mdash; and tracking whether the BEP actually responds to it &mdash; is manual and error-prone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-num">03</div>
        <h3>No AI for confidential projects</h3>
        <p>Generic AI tools send your project data to third-party providers. On sensitive infrastructure and defence projects, that&rsquo;s a non-starter. Teams need AI assistance without the privacy risk.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-num">04</div>
        <h3>ISO 19650 expertise assumed, not embedded</h3>
        <p>Templates assume the author already knows the standard inside out. They don&rsquo;t explain what each section needs, what good looks like, or how to align with the specific EIR. Expertise should be in the tool, not assumed from the user.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <div class="section-full fade-in">
    <div class="section-full-inner">
      {{ sectionHead("How It Works", "From EIR to compliant BEP &mdash; guided every step", "Five steps. One platform. No blank pages. Built around the way real teams respond to real EIRs.") }}

      <div class="step-flow">
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <h4>Upload EIR</h4>
          <p>Drop the client&rsquo;s EIR PDF into Capsar</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <h4>AI Extracts</h4>
          <p>Requirements parsed and structured automatically</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <h4>Guided Authoring</h4>
          <p>Smart Help on every field with AI-assisted content</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <h4>Gap Analysis</h4>
          <p>Responsiveness Matrix shows what&rsquo;s covered and what&rsquo;s not</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="step-num">5</div>
          <h4>Export</h4>
          <p>Professional PDF &amp; editable DOCX deliverables</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modules -->
  <section class="fade-in">
    {{ sectionHead("Platform", "10 integrated modules", "Core workflows for ISO 19650 information management &mdash; connected, not siloed, and shaped by delivery problems seen on live programmes.") }}

    <div class="page-hero-sub capsar-module-lede">
      Built around the tasks teams spend the most time on: understanding the EIR, drafting the BEP, tracking coverage, planning delivery, and keeping outputs consistent.
    </div>

    <div class="module-grid">
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>BEP Manager</h4>
        <p>Guided 14-section BEP authoring with consistent structure and prompts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7"/><path d="M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>EIR Manager</h4>
        <p>Requirement extraction and tracking from client EIR documents.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>OIR Manager</h4>
        <p>Organisational requirements captured in the same workflow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"/><line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>TIDP/MIDP</h4>
        <p>Delivery planning and tracking for information production and review.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>DC Manager</h4>
        <p>Document control and validation before submission.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="3.01" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="3.01" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="3.01" y2="18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>LOIN Tables</h4>
        <p>Level of Information Need tables with IDS export support.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><polyline points="21 8 21 21 3 21 3 8"/><rect x="1" y="3" width="22" height="5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>IFC Import</h4>
        <p>Model data extraction from IFC files where model inputs are needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Responsibility Matrix</h4>
        <p>Role and task assignments across delivery teams.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Capability Assessment</h4>
        <p>Supply chain readiness checks aligned to ISO 19650-2 Cl.5.3.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-item">
        <div class="module-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"/><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"/><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Snippets</h4>
        <p>Reusable content library for recurring responses and standards text.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comparison -->
  <div class="section-full fade-in">
    <div class="section-full-inner">
      {{ sectionHead("Comparison", "The difference Capsar makes", "Side-by-side: the old way vs. the Capsar way.") }}

      <table class="comparison-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th></th>
            <th>Without Capsar</th>
            <th>With Capsar</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Time to BEP</td>
            <td>2&ndash;4 weeks of manual drafting from blank templates</td>
            <td>3&ndash;5 days with AI-assisted authoring and guided workflows</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Quality</td>
            <td>Inconsistent structure, missed requirements, no gap tracking</td>
            <td>14-section ISO 19650 structure, Smart Help on every field, real-time guidance</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>EIR compliance</td>
            <td>Manual cross-referencing &mdash; requirements often missed or misinterpreted</td>
            <td>Automated Responsiveness Matrix with full EIR coverage and gap alerts</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="eir-cross-link">
        <strong>Reviewing an EIR before issuing it?</strong>
        <span>Run the free <a href="eir-checklist.html">EIR Health Check</a> first &mdash; 12 questions on a 0&ndash;3 clarity scale, your 3 most expensive gaps, and a free PDF report.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Privacy -->
  <section class="fade-in">
    <div class="privacy-callout">
      <div class="privacy-callout-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Your data stays yours</h4>
        <p>Capsar.io runs AI on dedicated infrastructure. Your project data is never sent to OpenAI, Google, Anthropic, or any third-party AI provider. Suitable for sensitive infrastructure, public-sector, and confidentiality-sensitive projects where data sovereignty matters.</p>
        <p class="capsar-note">Working on a tender now? Try the free <a href="eir-checklist.html" class="link-inline">EIR clarity check</a> and the <a href="bep-checklist.html" class="link-inline">BEP readiness checklist</a> &mdash; no email, no gating.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Screenshots -->
  <section class="fade-in" id="platform-preview">
    {{ sectionHead("Platform Preview", "What it looks like", "A glimpse at the Capsar.io interface &mdash; designed for practitioners.") }}

    <div class="screenshot-grid">
      <div class="screenshot-mockup">
        <div class="mockup-chrome">
          <div class="mockup-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="mockup-url">app.noeinsolutions.com/bep</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-screen">
          <div class="mockup-sidebar">
            <div class="mockup-sidebar-item active"></div>
            <div class="mockup-sidebar-item"></div>
            <div class="mockup-sidebar-item"></div>
            <div class="mockup-sidebar-item"></div>
            <div class="mockup-sidebar-item"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-content">
            <div class="mockup-heading"></div>
            <div class="mockup-field"></div>
            <div class="mockup-field short"></div>
            <div class="mockup-field"></div>
            <div class="mockup-ai-badge">Smart Help AI</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-label">BEP Manager &mdash; Smart Help AI on every field</div>
      </div>
      <div class="screenshot-mockup">
        <div class="mockup-chrome">
          <div class="mockup-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="mockup-url">app.noeinsolutions.com/matrix</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-screen mockup-screen--matrix">
          <div class="mockup-table-header">
            <div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-table-row"><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div><div class="mockup-cell warn"></div><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div></div>
          <div class="mockup-table-row"><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div><div class="mockup-cell gap"></div><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div></div>
          <div class="mockup-table-row"><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div><div class="mockup-cell pass"></div><div class="mockup-cell warn"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-label">EIR Responsiveness Matrix &mdash; live gap analysis</div>
      </div>
      <div class="screenshot-mockup">
        <div class="mockup-chrome">
          <div class="mockup-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="mockup-url">app.noeinsolutions.com/dc</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-screen mockup-screen--dc">
          <div class="mockup-stats-bar">
            <div class="mockup-stat-block pass-bg"></div>
            <div class="mockup-stat-block warn-bg"></div>
            <div class="mockup-stat-block"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-file-row"></div>
          <div class="mockup-file-row"></div>
          <div class="mockup-file-row"></div>
          <div class="mockup-file-row"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-label">DC Manager &mdash; validation &amp; compliance</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beta CTA -->
  <div class="section-full fade-in">
    <div class="section-full-inner section-full-inner--narrow">
      {{ sectionHead("Early Access", "Early access is open", "", "center") }}
      <p class="capsar-cta-lede">Free during beta. Limited spots. If you write BEPs, manage EIRs, or run digital delivery for AEC projects &mdash; Capsar.io was built for you.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions hero-actions--center">
        <a href="https://app.noeinsolutions.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Try Capsar.io</a>
        <a href="{{ site.calendly }}" onclick="Calendly.initPopupWidget({url:'{{ site.calendly }}'});return false;" class="btn btn-outline">Book a walkthrough</a>
      </div>
      <div class="capsar-badge">Free during beta &mdash; limited spots</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  </main>
